TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Keeps the now-playing artwork frame visible when a new image path arrives. Stock hides the frame when playback stops and does not always bring it back; this restores the frame class inside setArtworkImagePath. One insertion in /jci/gui/common/controls/NowPlaying4/js/NowPlaying4Ctrl.js; no image file is replaced."
